# Start Fresh
// CRITICAL: Execute these steps in order
// Return to @development-workflow.mdc when complete

## Context Reset
1. Clear previous context
   - Clear implementation details
   - Clear test assumptions
   - Clear cached file contents
   - Clear performance data

2. Return to workflow
   - Review @development-workflow.mdc
   - Identify current position in loop
   - Prepare for next step

Remember: Start each iteration fresh, work from rules only.

// IMPORTANT: When returning to @development-workflow.mdc, ensure status markers
// [previous], [current], and [next] are updated to reflect the new position
// in the development loop. This is MANDATORY for maintaining clear progress tracking. 